 why="Turns many O(n²) 'have I seen this?' searches into O(n). It is the first optimisation interviewers expect.",
 core=["A hash table stores keys in buckets chosen by a hash function. Average lookup, insert and delete are O(1); collisions make the worst case O(n).",
       "Patterns: count frequencies, remember the index where a value was first seen, check complements (target − x), group by a canonical key (sorted string for anagrams)."],
